  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0064_e02d9605aeda.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 202px;\"/></p><p>Area of parallelogram, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></math></p><p>Area of quadrilateral = Area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>OAB</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></math>Area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>OBC</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>{</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>}</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>{</mo><mo>|</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>}</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>{</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo